بعد الظهر
# Definite forms after an hour: "الساعة 4 العصر" is four in the afternoon and
# "الساعة 2 الظهر" is two after noon.  Wiktionary, عصر: "late afternoon",
# "ellipsis of صَلَاة الْعَصْر"; Wiktionary, ظهر (ظُهْر): "noon, midday",
# "afternoon, p.m.", citing Wehr, A Dictionary of Modern Written Arabic (1979).
# Alone, الظهر stays the noon landmark of clock_landmark_720.voc.
العصر
الظهر
